# The image is built from docker/entrypoints/ alone (docker/Dockerfile.runtime COPYs nothing
# else), so the build context is exactly that directory: tests, docs, tools, local radio configs,
# var/ (generated password files) and anything added later never reach the builder, and none of
# it can invalidate a cached layer. A new COPY source outside docker/entrypoints/ fails the build
# until it is listed here.
*
!docker/entrypoints/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
